1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,500
这个是洋中脊。
This is the mid-ocean ridge.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,900
两条纸带分别代表它两边的海底。
The two paper strips are the seafloor
on either side of it.

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:08,100
当两条纸带往外拉，新的纸从这里长出来，
When I pull the strips outward,
new paper comes out from here,

4
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,900
就像从洋中脊长出新的洋壳一样。
just like new oceanic crust
forming at the ridge.

5
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:16,700
当岩石冷却时，它会记录下当时地磁场的方向。
As the rock cools, it records the direction
of Earth's magnetic field at that time.

6
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,200
就像这样。
Like this.

7
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:22,500
而两条纸带所记录下的地磁场方向是完全对称的。
The magnetic patterns on the two strips
are perfectly symmetric.

8
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:28,700
那么假设这条磁带离洋中脊有一百公里远，而它的年龄为五百万年，
Now suppose this stripe is 100 km from the ridge
and 5 million years old.

9
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:31,800
那么半扩张速率就是一百公里除以五百万年，
Then the half-spreading rate is
100 km ÷ 5 million years,

10
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:33,700
也就是两厘米每年。
which is 2 cm per year.
